   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Dark alpine: median ~56 (darkest of the 20), near-neutral cool blacks (34,34,39), warm highlights (228,208,192), reds 30% and blues 26% of colour mass, saturation 0.29. Best for: Moody mountain frames, storm light, peaks with dramatic cloud, dark pre-dawn landscapes, hiker/couple-in-landscape silhouettes. Needs a frame with a bright light source to shine.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
